      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000o6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Your child does not need to be potty trained"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000o7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000o8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Many of our 2½ and 3-year-olds are still in diapers or pull-ups when they start. That's normal, and we're happy to help."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000o9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000oa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How long potty training usually takes"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000ob",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000oc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Every child is different. Toilet training often starts somewhere between 21 and 36 months, and only about 40 to 60 percent of children are fully trained by their third birthday, according to a review in the journal of the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000oe",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k000od"
          ],
          "text": "American Academy of Family Physicians"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000of",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Staying dry at night usually comes later than staying dry during the day. Starting earlier doesn't always mean finishing earlier, so we follow your child's readiness signs, like staying dry for a couple of hours, telling you about a wet diaper or showing interest in the toilet."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k000od",
          "_type": "link",
          "external": "https://www.aafp.org/pubs/afp/issues/2008/1101/p1059.html",
          "linkType": "external",
          "openInNewTab": true
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000og",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000oh",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How we work on it together"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000oi",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000oj",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We talk with you about the words and steps you use at home, and use the same ones."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000ok",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000ol",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Children get regular bathroom breaks and gentle reminders."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000om",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000on",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We celebrate every success and treat accidents calmly. We never shame a child."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000oo",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000op",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We tell you how the day went so you can keep going at home."
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000oq",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000or",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What to bring"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000os",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000ot",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Diapers or pull-ups, plus two or three changes of clothes, all labeled with your child's name. We provide the wipes. Clothes that are easy to pull down help a lot: overalls and lots of snaps slow little ones down."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
